Subject: [PATCH 1/3] The address we advertise is the domain we own

plivariverlodge.com is bought and live on our own server with a valid
certificate, so it is the only address to hand out. The netlify.app copy
stays as the fallback and nothing else changes for it.

  * the body of every enquiry email named the netlify.app copy
    (netlify/functions/enquiry.mjs) - the guest read it;
  * marketing/out/ was stale: the masters use {{SITE_URL}} and
    site-config.json has carried the domain for a while, but the rendered
    copy files still had the old address. Re-rendered, 11 files;
  * README, deploy/README, deploy/SETUP, docs/enquiry-email and
    marketing/README pointed at the netlify copy as the site.

The references that stay are the ones about the Netlify platform itself:
the branch preview domains, the fallback, the redirect source in
deploy/set-domain.sh and the "via ... " example in SETUP.md.

